    {"id":3,"type":"logs","title":"Logs recientes","datasource":{"type":"loki","uid":"loki"},"targets":[{"refId":"A","expr":"{service=~\".*-service\"}"}],"gridPos":{"h":10,"w":24,"x":0,"y":8}}
  ]
